{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act13side_level_act13side_06_beg",
  "groupId": "act13side",
  "stageId": "act13side_06",
  "title": "被包围者",
  "storyCode": "NL-6",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act13side/level_act13side_06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "05c7a214ab313974f652b6050cec41c04f6b8948fb57506842936f812e24dbe0",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡西米尔2 6-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G05"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "开始了。感染者的行动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......他们真的会主动撞枪口上来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们最好会。我们把动静闹大一点，董事会抓不住我们的把柄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "动力炉那边......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是在质疑我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不敢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可以杀掉野鬃吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......当然，事已至此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有几个猎物的话，饲主也不会大发雷霆了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本来，就是从我手底下逃走的猎物......我只是取回我早该得到的东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "通知第三小队，收队，跟我走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G05"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "发现野鬃！发现——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太慢了，无胄盟！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "躲在暗处耍阴招，你们已经忘了该怎么对付骑士了吗！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "该死的感染者！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为了杰米，和那些死在你们手里的无辜者！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咿——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——艾沃娜！别忘了索娜说的，不要随意下杀手......至少，在杀他们的时候，做好觉悟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......无胄盟，你杀过多少人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "道貌岸然才能让你们自诩正义吗？小鬼头？我在黄金草原当赏金猎人的时候，可从来没想过这个问题！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "忘了城市之外的地方，卡西米尔人是怎么活着的了吗？很简单的道理！最强大的求生者全是冷酷的混账！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——随你怎么说，无胄盟，但现在，是我赢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "输了，死了，说什么都是徒劳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......他刚才应该已经发出了求救信号。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希望能把无胄盟吸引过来，不要干扰到格蕾纳蒂的行动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G07"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查丝汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑟奇亚克",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "远牙，你那边发现无胄盟了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查丝汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查丝汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你那边呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑟奇亚克",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "格蕾纳蒂已经就位了，只等我们的信号。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑟奇亚克",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，无胄盟的反应速度不会这么慢......他们真的有被野鬃吸引过去吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查丝汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "应该......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查丝汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查丝汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "发现无胄盟小队，他们从四号大街的小巷进入了你的包围网，艾沃娜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查丝汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......艾沃娜？听得见吗？艾沃娜？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查丝汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂！？瑟奇亚克？艾沃娜！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查丝汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......通讯......被......截断了？不可能......在信号这么密集的城市里......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G05"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安静得有些可怕......艾沃娜，我有不好的预感。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无胄盟真的会被我们伏击吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比起这个，刚才开始我就接不到查丝汀娜的通讯了，她应该在高点盯着我们这片才对——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（恶寒）——————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——快跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "突然之间，艾沃娜感到了一股足以让人当场呕吐的窒息感。\n她不确定这种感觉真的是生理反应，还是某种毒素或法术的效果。\n有一道人影从高楼的顶端一跃而下。\n落在地上，却像轻轻蒙上的纱布一般，没有发出分毫声响。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......从那么高的地方跳下来，连动静都没有吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们菲林都是这么方便的生物吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......第三小队。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这些家伙——什么时候！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（和刚才的那些无胄盟有质的差距......这家伙，蓝色的，是上次那个青金吗？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们先走......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你要活下来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃啊！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不可能，根本没看到她拉弓——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "青色的无胄盟保持着单手投掷的姿势。\n她冷漠的面庞上闪过一丝不悦，因这场捕猎游戏有一个不吉利的开端而不悦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......用，投的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘎啊，我的腿，我的腿！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咬牙，继续跑！别停下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，别瞎看了，我还在这里呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......感染者都是些傻子吗。数数看这里有几把弩对着你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "野鬃骑士，本来你好几天前就该死了，不过正好，今天你还有一个逞英雄的机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跑吧，我也不想这么无趣地结束这场猎杀。打发打发时间也好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，你好像误会了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看起来像是一直四处逃窜的那类人吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你像是自寻死路的那类人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啐，感染者已经厌倦了这种苟且偷生的日子了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无胄盟，你们只是一些躲在商业联合会背后做着龌龊勾当的家伙，这里坦荡活着的每一个人都比你们要更强！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "要记住他们每一个人的脸......！\n记住......那些骑士......那些卡西米尔人......这些阴狠的凶手......\n别放过，他们任何一个......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......无胄盟渣滓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你和垂死的钳兽战斗过吗？无胄盟？你知道那些自知命不久矣的畜生，是怎么战斗的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "自不量力......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也许我会死，但我不会输，你们，一定会在这里付出代价。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然后......我的伙伴们，将会......"
