      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......您怎么来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "早说一声，我应该接待您才是，罗素阁下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗素",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不劳你费心了，我很快就走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗素",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今夜不会平静，会有不少事情需要处理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗素",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "玛恩纳，那个提剑远游的游侠回来了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗素",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "穿过尸骸堆砌的战场与无垠废土，被炮火焚烧的要塞尽头，那个游侠还没有回来吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G04"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾纳蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——还没有收到联络，但是我们已经等不了了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾纳蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "五分钟内，我们要突袭并切断核心电力源，确保商业联合会所在的核心城区失去电力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾纳蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只有这样，索娜才有潜入商业联合会的机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......玩挺大的啊，我喜欢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾纳蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......监正会的“朋友”应该已经秘密调走了这里的安保，避免任何武力冲突。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾纳蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "速度要快，准备行动——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾纳蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什、什么！？哪里的爆炸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾纳蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能、能源区？为什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑟奇亚克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103nc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "灰毫！为什么要提前行动！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾纳蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我们根本还没冲进去——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑟奇亚克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103nc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——被算计了，快撤！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G07"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "睡吧，卡瓦莱利亚基，我心爱的大骑士领。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "晚安。"
